  "annotations": [
    {
      "id": "read-me",
      "x": 1030,
      "y": 0,
      "w": 300,
      "text": "Three directions, same product.\n\nEach row below is one complete direction: nine mobile screens, left to right, in the order someone would meet them.\n\nAll numbers, names and ratings are sample content."
    },
    {
      "id": "dir-a",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 940,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "A \u00b7 MIZAN \u2014 the ledger\nWarm paper, Instrument Serif, hairline rules. Trust is the hero; the game is kept quiet. Closest to the current halalfood.world."
    },
    {
      "id": "dir-b",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 1944,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "B \u00b7 SUHOOR \u2014 the night market\nDark, amber and mint, Archivo. Leagues, seasons, streak multipliers, a live city feed. The loudest option."
    },
    {
      "id": "dir-c",
      "x": 0,
      "y": 2948,
      "w": 420,
      "text": "C \u00b7 ZELLIGE \u2014 the passport\nCream, teal and saffron, Syne, 2px ink borders. Verification is four tiles you turn; contributions collect into city passports."
    }
  ],
